mill-proof.md:1: argue/readings: S3 is read 2 ways: mill-proof.logic.r2 has "proven_good → desires_own"; mill-proof.logic.r2.2 and mill-proof.logic.r2.3 have "desires_own → proven_good"; they differ when only "each person, so far as he believes it to be attainable, desires his own happiness" is true, which the first allows
